{"id":"cd307d59aba6545f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler.md","title":"必胜承诺下的总指标编译","display":"thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler — 必胜承诺下的总指标编译","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler","aliases":["20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler"],"display":"thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler — 必胜承诺下的总指标编译","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(i),(iv) 的量词审查；本地编译证明","source_printed_pages":[218],"source_pdf_pages":[247],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler — 必胜承诺下的总指标编译"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(i),(iv) 的量词审查；本地编译证明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8609481d2b84cdde\" href=\"?note=8609481d2b84cdde\" title=\"20-lem-open-winning-certificate\">20-lem-open-winning-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}\">\\(S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]\">\\(A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]\\)</span>。合法特征指标条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\">\\(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}\">\\(H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}\\)</span> 为 I 的历史域；记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))\">\\(\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))\\)</span>，作为部分策略程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算一元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8609481d2b84cdde\" href=\"?note=8609481d2b84cdde\" title=\"20-lem-open-winning-certificate\">20-lem-open-winning-certificate</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open-winning-strategy-compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall k\\\n\\left[(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open-winning-strategy-compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall k\\\n\\left[(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 编译如下策略程序：枚举全部有限候选树，并行验证树形、回合分枝和每个叶节点的一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_k\">\\(S_k\\)</span> 前缀；找到完整证书后，在输入历史上查有限表，表外输出 0。s-m-n 给一个总指标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，它返回上述程序的代码，不需在返回代码前等待证书。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_k\">\\(\\varphi_k\\)</span> 是特征函数且 I 必胜，证书搜索必终止，故该策略程序在每个历史上停止并获胜。</p>\n<p>这一编译结论不保证 I 败的输入上输出程序全定义。因此，按本目录通常的“指标→程序”语义，原书 Exercise 15.1.2(iv) 的字面否定与该显式编译冲突；其可成立的更强条件是要求所有有效输入都产生全策略，包括 I 败的游戏，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f917b5f20ec04176\" href=\"?note=f917b5f20ec04176\" title=\"20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection\">20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection</a>。两种量词条件分开列出，不以“非统一”一词替代精确接口。此订正是本地证明结论，未冒称原书已经给出。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 218 / PDF 247，已渲染逐字核对原页。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-open-winning-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"8609481d2b84cdde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-open-winning-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"8609481d2