ategy-selection","status":"resolved","id":"f917b5f20ec04176","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这一编译结论不保证 I 败的输入上输出程序全定义。因此，按本目录通常的“指标→程序”语义，原书 Exercise 15.1.2(iv) 的字面否定与该显式编译冲突；其可成立的更强条件是要求所有有效输入都产生全策略，包括 I 败的游戏，见 [[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。两种量词条件分开列出，不以“非统一”一词替代精确接口。此订正是本地证明结论，未冒称原书已经给出。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}","display":false},{"tex":"H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open-winning-strategy-compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall k\\\n\\left[(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"S_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_k","display":false}],"bytes":2719,"backlinks":[{"id":"8372f8b6f584a62e","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I 的任意胜策由有限分枝紧致性给有限获胜证书。有限表记录证书内部的行动，其他全部历史取默认位，故是全可计算胜策。该搜索在 I 必胜承诺下终止；索引编译与承诺全定义性另见 [[20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]、[[20-thm-exact-pair]]；有限损伤 [[20-thm-low-simple]]、[[20-thm-fm]]、[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；Δ₂ 扩展 [[20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance]]、[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；基定理 [[20-thm-low-basis]]、[[20-thm-superlow-basis]]；博弈 [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]、[[20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler]]、[[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。"}],"outgoing":["8609481d2b84cdde","8ba6597a854c206f","dc642dd12c05d028","f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","755e421576224435","e343870c773cb68e","f917b5f20ec04176"]}